    "body": "First public release of **Cyberpunk RED - Combat HUD** for Foundry VTT **V12** (system: `cyberpunk-red-core`).\n\n### Install in Foundry\nAdd-on Modules → Install Module → paste this **Manifest URL**:\n\n```\nhttps://github.com/Vec97/cpr-combat-hud/releases/latest/download/module.json\n```\n\n### What's in the bar\n- HP bar (+/- buttons & direct entry), armor SP/shield with ablate-repair, Humanity, LUCK, Death Save.\n- All ten stats, one-click rolls through the system dialog (Ctrl-click skips it).\n- Equipped weapons with Attack/Damage, reload, ammo swap, and Aimed/Autofire/Suppressive toggles.\n- Searchable skills panel with favourites (shown in an expandable row), role abilities, and the netrunner interface panel.\n- Initiative & end-turn combat controls; weapon equip-state management.\n\nEvery roll runs through the system's own pipeline, so mods, wound penalties, luck and targeting behave exactly like the character sheet.\n\nSee the full [CHANGELOG](https://github.com/Vec97/cpr-combat-hud/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md).\n"
